<section id="scenes" aria-labelledby="h-scenes">
  <h2 id="h-scenes" class="sec">Scenes</h2>
  <p class="sub">The videos from each scored run, one card per task. Click a picture to play it.</p>
  <div class="filters" id="scenes-filters" hidden>
    <label>Run <select id="sc-run"></select></label>
    <label>Family <select id="sc-fam"></select></label>
  </div>
  <p class="callout" id="sc-empty" style="margin-top:0">Loading scenes.</p>
  <div class="scenes" id="sc-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <p class="scnote" id="sc-note" hidden>The judge's comments are its own words and are often in Chinese.</p>
  <p class="scnote" id="sc-attr"><span id="sc-model"></span>Rollouts start from <a href="https://github.com/kxding/PlayWorld" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PlayWorld</a> task images, which come from Pexels and web image search under their own terms. Scene videos are released under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>, non-commercial. To request removal of a scene, <a href="https://github.com/benceruleanlu/playworld-advancement/issues/new?title=Scene+removal+request" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open an issue</a>. <a id="sc-files" href="https://github.com/benceruleanlu/playworld-advancement/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>All files</a></p>
</section>
